Package: oxview
Type: Package
Title: Local Canvas Preview for xlsx, docx, and pptx Files
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("Jan Marvin", "Garbuszus", email = "jan.garbuszus@ruhr-uni-bochum.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
  person("Yuki", "Yokotani", role = c("cph"), comment = "Author of included ooxml library")
  )
Description: Renders .xlsx, .docx, and .pptx files using the bundled
    '@silurus/ooxml' JavaScript/WebAssembly viewer, served locally via
    'httpuv' and shown in the RStudio Viewer pane or default browser.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
